Changes made for MicroWorkout
-----------------------------
    Rasterized and downscaled from 512 x 512 to 384 x 384 (Lanczos filter);
    redundant white RGB collapsed to a single grayscale channel (mode LA);
    alpha quantized to 4 levels {0, 85, 170, 255}; all PNG metadata stripped;
    recoloured at runtime by tinting the grayscale art through the theme text
    token.

